      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嘘……！不要动。\n虽然可能有点不舒服，\n但就这样屏住呼吸撑过去吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebabe411699aba47afc1ba43b4b0fd6aa6fdde9eb0a71b331ded71fc6345d622",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
